 ## Background
-The method was proposed by Xin Li, W. Chen, X. Wu, and W. Zuo in the paper "Fast projected tetrahedra volume rendering based on parallelized accurate sorting" published in August 2013 [S1, unofficial]. It addresses the limitations of parallel performance in projected tetrahedra rendering due to the sequence and dependency of neighboring tetrahedra [S1, unofficial][S2, unofficial].
